    title: "GOVERNANCE+SECURITY: mirror remote URL embeds a Codeberg token in cleartext (leaks via any git remote -v); auto-pr/merge-pr print stale 'Codeberg' labels for GitHub pushes"  # 0af8
    status: needs_human_review  # 0af8
