  message: "OWNER RULING (2026-08-17), verbatim: \"already rotated it is inert doesnt matter\".\n\nThe credential in the `mirror` remote URL has been rotated and the exposed value is\ndead, so the security facet is closed. Nothing to do.\n\nRESIDUE, recorded so it is not rediscovered as a bug: `auto-pr` and `merge-pr` still\nprint \"Pushing to Codeberg\" and a codeberg.org URL for what is a GitHub push. Purely\ncosmetic and it misleads a reader of the logs (it did in this session). Both are\ngovernance files, so it stays unfixed absent an explicit ask. Not re-filed as its own\nitem — the fact lives in LIVE.md §7 where a log reader will meet it."  # 62d5
